Welcome! We are so glad you are coming. Here is everything you need for the evening.

## When and where

kpi Date | Thu 2026-11-12
kpi Time | 17:30 to 19:30
kpi Place | Main building | 410 Elm Street

## Schedule

step Welcome from the principal, in the gym | 17:30
step Classroom tours in groups of 8 families, about 30 minutes each | 17:50
step Kindergarten information session, in the library | 18:30
step After-school program table, in the cafeteria | 18:45
step Closing words | 19:15

## What to bring

Planning to register your child for kindergarten in 2027-28? Bring these with you:

- [ ] Birth certificate
- [ ] Proof of address
- [ ] Immunization records

! Kindergarten registration opens on 2027-01-12.

## Getting here

- **Parking:** free in the Elm Street lot. It has 60 spaces.
- **Shuttle:** free, every 10 minutes from the Pine Street church lot.
- **Childcare:** bring the little ones. We offer childcare for siblings in the music room.

## Questions

We are happy to help. Call us on **555-0166** or write to [office@cedarwood.example](mailto:office@cedarwood.example).

See you there!
